Z||000005||loafer87gt||04-17-2001||08:50 PM||||Cliff, if you are looking for another good FPS get Serious Sam. I just picked it up for $25 and it is an absolute blast to play. It reminds me of the original Doom game, as it throws hundreds of enemies at you per level. The graphics are excellent, and it runs like greased lightning on even a p3 500. It has several multiplayer modes as well, cooperative, deathmatch, and a couple of other neat mods. Great game, and the price is right.||||reg||1
